  "Question": "90 kilometers are traveled in 2 hours. How many kilometers are traveled in 4 hours at the same speed? Calculate: \\(90\\div2\\times4=?\\)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "180",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "At 45 kilometers per hour, the distance traveled in 4 hours is 180 kilometers.\n\nAlternative method 1: Add two equal time intervals\n\nFour hours consists of two \\(2\\)-hour intervals. At the same speed, each interval covers \\(90\\) kilometers, so the total distance is\n\\[\n90+90=180\\text{ kilometers}.\n\\]",
